menu "FDict One UI"

    config FD_SLEEP_BTN
        bool "Nut Ngu (deep sleep) trong bang cai dat nhanh"
        default y
        help
            Hien nut Ngu trong bang keo xuong; xac nhan -> deep sleep ( danh thuc bang nut bat ky).
            Disable if sleep (soft power-off) misbehaves, e.g. shared I2C with ES8311 on the Freenove board.

endmenu